== Symbolism ==
The purple violet is the [[Provinces and territories of Canada|provincial]] flower of [[New Brunswick]].<ref>{{cite book | author-link=Neltje Blanchan |last=Blanchan |first=| year=2005 | publisher=[[Project Gutenberg]] Literary Archive Foundation}}</ref>

The purple violet is the national flower of New Brunswick’s province. The purple violet is the official flower of the sorority [[Sigma Sigma Sigma]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=Our Story • Tri State|url=https://trisigma.org/our-story/ |access-date=2024-06-16 |website=Tri Sigma |language=en-US}}</ref>

The purple violet is also one of the official flowers of the [[Sigma Phi Epsilon]] fraternity.{{Citation needed|date=September 2022}}

